# jemdoc: menu{MENU}{research.html}
== Research

Research interests: mathematical optimization, data science, numerical analysis, scientific computing, machine learning, and control, with applications spanning quantum computing, biomedical science, and materials design.

[research-highlights.html Research Highlights] — Explore the significance and my contributions behind six papers on derivative-free optimization.

