=== LLMs for Optimization

I am preparing for release a study of reusable prompts intended to improve optimization algorithms across solver families. A complementary project will benchmark LLM-designed DFO algorithms for both numerical performance and convergence guarantees under explicit assumptions. It will evaluate algorithm descriptions, proof arguments, and executable implementations, testing symbolic reasoning together with numerical judgment. Transferability and performance gains will be assessed through controlled experiments.

